 2012 al 2016. Ha anche lavorato alla voce per Ice Age , laserie di film del Madagascar , Charlotte's Web , Planes and Planes: Fire & Rescue . Attualmente recita nellasitcom della CBS The Neighbourhood . Nel 2019 ha ricevuto una stella sulla Hollywood Walk of Fame .","biography_language":"it","biography_source":"tmdb","birthday":"1964-04-24","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Caloo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uCRXsCpMZJDrxAAXJC2xHOz6r9T.jpg","role":"","title":"Swapped - Al tuo posto","tmdb_id":1007757,"type":"movie","year":2026},{"character":"Calvin Butler","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7w3cO1JTDXxP7oJ3GimIxiG79n4.jpg","role":"","title":"Crutch","tmdb_id":253750,"type":"tv","year":2025},{"character":"Stu Smiley","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aF7UyqtzLHtsY0wTOqPrqVzQLee.jpg","role":"","title":"Unfrosted: storia di uno snack americano","tmdb_id":844185,"type":"movie","year":2024},{"character":"Bobby (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gdEgod2RNMpyBFV3S3CEDd3HJpz.jpg","role":"","title":"La famiglia Proud - Più forte e orgogliosa","tmdb_id":125438,"type":"tv","year":2022},{"character":"Reverend Ralph Abernathy","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nE095bNnPrjOD57TGYDvKW3QcJ2.jpg","role":"","title":"Il colore della libertà","tmdb_id":686548,"type":"movie","year":2021},{"character":"Calvin Butler","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7NQRz0RcN2ohT98fZv287YEddtW.jpg","role":"","title":"Bob Hearts Abishola","tmdb_id":92461,"type":"tv","year":2019},{"character":"Pastor Joel Jeffers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/mKQ9Z2EdxWSRxeVxsgCnqb3QjBt.jpg","role":"","title":"First Reformed - La creazione a rischio","tmdb_id":458737,"type":"movie","year":2018},{"character":"Calvin Butler","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uItUViUsFAY7wzufTS2zWNbuuAm.jpg","role":"","title":"The Neighborhood","tmdb_id":81144,"type":"tv","year":2018},{"character":"Eddie","poster":"ht